			"notes": "Updated to 7.2 Pre1!\n\nNew Blocks and Items:\n\n- Tatami made from cactus\n- Obsidian Glass Door\n- Scorchedstone stairs\n\nChanges: \n\n- Many blocks have had texture updates\n- Some blocks now have a item texture icon\n- More blocks are sorted in creative inventory\n- Burn times on saplings now match vanilla ones\n\nNOTICE - \nThis update does support the mod and worlds from 7.1 but be aware\nany blocks that are new to 7.2 that were in bonus blocks 7.1 will now appear untextured but will convert naturally into the new blocks\nanything broken or placed with also instantly convert\n\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/LukeisStuff/bonusblocks/compare/2.4.2...3.0"
